data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"### Canon\n- **Asha Pell:** Born on Orin; moved to Vesper at age six. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. It opens the old lens room beneath Vesper’s lighthouse; only Iven knows she has it.\n- **Iven Marr:** Lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates the *Nightjar* using tide charts, not magic.\n- **Bren Vale:** Refuses to join the Lantern Guild because he distrusts Tal Ren’s friends. His older sister Nessa cooks aboard the *Petrel*; she is not his employee on a formal wage. Nessa keeps Button, a black cat, aboard.\n- **The *Nightjar*:** Its current route carries letters from Vesper to Kest, a southern island. Its former April–September blue-salt route is retired.\n- **Lens room:** Permanently sealed by a rockfall in 318; nobody has reopened it, and it has no other entrance.\n\n### Unresolved contradiction\nA note says Iven meets Sera inside the room in 320 to negotiate a salt contract. That conflicts with the room being sealed and inaccessible since 318, and with Asha not letting Iven negotiate contracts. No reconciliation is established."}}}

