 island. Its former April–September blue-salt route is retired.\n- **Lens room:** Permanently sealed by a rockfall in 318; nobody has reopened it, and it has no other entrance.\n\n### Unresolved contradiction\nA note says Iven meets Sera inside the room in 320 to negotiate a salt contract. That conflicts with the room being sealed and inaccessible since 318, and with Asha not letting Iven negotiate contracts. No reconciliation is established."}],"origin":{"api":"openai.chat","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","response_model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","response_id":"gen-1793273791-q4kKjAG8tfScBEEkMpgs"},"stop":"stop"}],"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"","native":{"item":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq4y_D6sJbqCH_94gONQPc4q-VdtY0i3akusg8KCDi15Od1LnIjSWhohJ2thYQzkIpHNg9Q3Vln0QuA6-ZXmymMv9VzF1CwMeKi66MMtiV2LYi6Fpw4Ek1Fo21uheng6Gz0suF9y0eOV_qkiKCK9bGiqelwvTcCjyhHH6rOlvFAOBXo6VubQlhKmtMwDE1PHeeJbkC82BB9vFGJxDJuGcVHhRVlIRl0pyYfHqVReMbH0h_VOTw25zsK1cJNkAg_ekBOQzPmgzqs2Zmy8Rpia3FwJseSHnUM5sqVz_OCMr7F_EVHe3bB6UDvmQSBnNkzYLMXJRsiVoGrjmB8aHNbMafPAK00F1ywlV0v2ZAL9t0O7e15WuZc0C5Q2qZzXWxi1ay9DnKqFVE3tiLeNpHwNPfh4idg9zKsieFY--x6iMF0LP1leXKjBS8xZDE7OAqIS7ArinSODFxSe70TosHMbDJY8Gec9SVIwjRgSPIW9CNtnhxHeaVHmi8ZHjbnUdF1swNnsrmhlmURnf0d_VY9n4ugD6FeRyK7cDaD2v1cQ1N86uIYAfF66Vz8a-qw5krCypEAeKnn08abfkGYFiCtNN-x58aw5VfGNXqTCX-kN9HHCWksS951cHGDC375DSrBCWsusNAbGayEK0-BV7EanqgegEJRWqCZru1drqf7kSSrOGFcWa0dNKq_Xl9yutWBasa9DdTMViO_Qjv297O1SPfknZLoiSgaguQzYQzE_IS1EvDieGFYmJ3SGZaf-hG048_JeDdACIchmRg2pP6ahEDpAV3Cow7H0avvQMUntoyApVmqsltgpvpwBMfM4iQG7wTdLE-sI0L0G_tEMkXaIEDixynCnJiNfu3UYVUwtzYJ-kV7R7nbnZq_wgdV9-zLB9hLI9p_2R6BH7MsAFhje1wDL_X2dg6uzTM_YwtmkvHSm_POfzGlBs3ZprUJUuwc2FS_xLKMKPJHzlCYolifD1L-j5ZlQarIe8SfUaUUzbeD1VHCg32MhwdU_G-NWhRo7wF64BAyVw90nwJLoEd7bX_Ogxe3nIyhn-qd2eNHGKFH4qIswl3Pitj-jd2kBZjdhsNHl-mMK15E4_YhPjTRWSw4ByBdbBf-QdO09QnRcJ3PmfF595vqkYjj_wtVADEyTHE0vTjWbmqb7jafcLmtPmyzl0-OU7mMI1-DOWsX3FkAxHLgPPR1hvKWEgyIrhmUUBndYODKb6hX1UlcN8Na2Ug